    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "C. 74M² 3-BEDROOM & 1 BATHROOM SEMI DETACHED HOUSE IN GREAT CONDITION, HAVING BEEN RECENTLY REFURBISHED & UPGRADED.  WITH UPVC DOUBLE GLAZING,  GOOD REAR GARDEN, AIR TO WATER HEATING SYSTEM AND  OFF STREET PARKING. EXCELLENT LOCATION CLOSE TO HARBOUR, SOUTH BEACH, ARKLOW GOLF CLUB AND JUST MINUTES WALK TO ARKLOW TOWN CENTRE."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nOPEN PLAN LIVING/DINING/KITCHEN - (7.80M X 4.70M)\r\nWith laminate flooring, brick open fireplace with timber mantle, walk in under stairs storage & stairs to first floor.\r\nFitted shaker style kitchen with extractor hood, tiled splash backs and freestanding Normende washing machine, Tricity Bendix Electric cooker and Thor fridge/freezer.\t  \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR ACCOMMODATION \r\n\r\nLANDING – (3.00M X 1.40M + 0.93M X 1.34M)\r\nWith carpeted stairs and landing.  Attic access.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 - (2.10M X 2.79M)\t\t\t\r\nLocated to the rear of the property with carpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 - (2.80M X 2.50M)\r\nLocated to the rear of the property with carpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nSHOWER ROOM - (2.27M X 1.91M)\r\nWith white suite wc and vanity sink, tiled built in shower unit (Triton T90xr).  Lino flooring and  Heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3 - (2.90M X 3.6M) + (0.75M x 1.13M)\r\nLocated to the rear of the property with carpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nGARDEN\r\nOff street parking for 2 cars to the front of the house and gated side entrance.  Enclosed gravelled rear garden with \r\nTimber fenced boundaries. \r\n\r\nSERVICES\r\nESB, Water & Sewerage – general mains supply. \r\nHeating System –  Air to Water Heating System and open fireplace in Sitting Room. \r\nExternal Windows & Doors – u.PVC double glazing throughout.\r\nBER – A (Number: 102497112)\r\n\r\nGENERAL\r\nRaymond Gaffney & Sons Ltd. are delighted to bring No. 5 Greggs Hill, Arklow to the market.  The property has been completely refurbished both inside and out.  Location is second to none, it is a short walk away from the Harbour, South Quay, South Beach, Arklow Golf Club, and lower main street in Arklow. This is a lovely home in a fantastic location with an enclosed rear garden that would make an Ideal starter home for an owner-occupier or as a buy-to-let investment.  Viewing highly recommended to appreciate this lovely family home and surrounding locations."
      },
